WEBVTT

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:06.550
Someone!

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:08.460
It's futile...

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:11.170
I told you these rooms are soundproofed.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:13.710
You little bitch!

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:26.840
Next time, I'll set the voltage to maximum.

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:28.880
Get back to bed.

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:39.360
<i>Aki's useless!</i>

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>I'd planned to join Hirashiro, 
so we could discover his secret...</i>

00:00:45.430 --> 00:00:47.270
<i>She kidnapped a civilian?</i>

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:48.960
<i>Shiba Hibino.</i>

00:00:49.850 --> 00:00:52.530
<i>The girl whose family Kuga Kyohei is staying with.</i>

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:58.160
<i>Abandoning a classmate just doesn't feel right.</i>

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:04.290
Takehisa-kun, head for the Setagaya penthouse...

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:14.740
The key to that penthouse should be 
around here somewhere...

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:17.830
Knew it.

00:01:18.070 --> 00:01:19.750
Next is...

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:29.260
You know what'll happen if you 
continue to struggle, right?

00:01:34.210 --> 00:01:35.290
<i>Hibino-san...</i>

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:12.000
Who the hell are you?

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:17.630
Hello!

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:21.830
I'm disappointed in you.

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:24.720
To think you lost to a little girl like that...

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:27.550
I was counting on you, too.

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:31.670
Handle the rest yourself.

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:32.680
Bye!

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:35.010
Ah! So busy. So busy.

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:45.160
<b>Episode 12</b>

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:45.160
<b>Out of Control</b>

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:47.910
You, Aki-san...

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:52.460
Kuga-kun's got a lot of scary friends, doesn't he?

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:56.840
I'm not his friend.

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:02.690
How could I have any friends 
in either the Kuga or Hyuga?

00:04:02.690 --> 00:04:03.570
You understand?

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:06.910
They're the rulers, and we're the peasants.

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:10.470
Where can you find friendship in that?

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:13.770
Kuga-kun doesn't think that way.

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:18.540
He's a spoiled kid from a rich family.

00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:22.230
Even if he stopped being a Seki, 
he wouldn't lose his position.

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:24.110
So things are easy for him!

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:27.740
Even if he thinks he's my friend,

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:30.330
that was only when we were kids!

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:31.510
He's...

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:37.110
We're done talking.

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:39.880
Your luck ran out when you met Kyohei.

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:42.420
Blame him for this.

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:47.090
Kuuko?

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:50.820
That's a driver with a metal head.

00:04:50.820 --> 00:04:52.370
What are you doing here?

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:55.840
I've been investigating Karakami Village...

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:57.060
And then I came here!

00:04:58.180 --> 00:04:59.280
Forget it.

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:01.310
A lot's happened.

00:05:02.770 --> 00:05:06.490
Oh, man! Look at that posture.

00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:08.300
Wh-What?

00:05:08.300 --> 00:05:11.570
The famous Shiba Hibino, 
tied down on a bed.

00:05:11.570 --> 00:05:13.990
I bet if I took a picture of this, 
I could get a fortune...

00:05:13.990 --> 00:05:15.660
Don't be stupid! Untie me!

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:18.940
Kidding, kidding.

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:21.170
Oh my!

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:25.170
To think I would find you here!

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:32.490
Hirashiro!

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:34.290
I thought you'd be here...

00:05:34.290 --> 00:05:36.120
You've really done it now.

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:39.480
I don't want to hear that from a kidnapper.

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:41.090
That way, Hibino!

00:05:42.260 --> 00:05:43.130
Wait!

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:44.070
Wait, I said!

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:48.760
Hurry, Kuuko!

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:57.420
Kuuko!

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:04.960
Get out of here!

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.090
Kuuko! Kuuko!

00:06:07.730 --> 00:06:10.840
That was a mistake, Karahari Kuuko-kun.

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:10.080
Kuuko!

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:12.930
Hey! Open up!

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:13.490
Don't you think this is a bad idea?

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:14.850
A diet member shooting people?

00:06:13.730 --> 00:06:14.850
Kukko!

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:16.650
I don't mind.

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:16.820
Hey!

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:19.010
I have plenty of people to take the fall for me.

00:06:18.050 --> 00:06:20.050
Kuuko! This is crazy!

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:21.970
She seems concerned.

00:06:21.220 --> 00:06:23.350
Kuuko! Kuuko!

00:06:21.970 --> 00:06:23.520
You should let her back in.

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:26.740
You idiot! Stop messing around and 
get out of here!

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:29.150
There's obviously no way I can do that!

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:30.280
Open up!

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:34.590
It'll be easier for me to deal with this alone!

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:35.980
Just go.

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:38.920
I didn't know you cared so much about your friends.

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:40.540
How touching.

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:44.240
I was telling the truth...

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:48.510
I can handle you myself!

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:02.480
Kuuko! Kuuko!

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:04.760
Hold on... I'll call an ambulance!

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:07.310
Wait.

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:13.570
Kyohei-sama said he wouldn't go back with me.

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:17.380
Is he rejecting me?

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.080
What do you think?

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:21.880
Shiba Hibino...

00:07:23.260 --> 00:07:24.840
<i>Right now Kuuko is...</i>

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:28.300
Pay attention.

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:32.800
Jeez...

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:46.540
Did you kill him?

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:50.690
Why is this?

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:53.040
Murderer!

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:55.100
I am not!

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:57.650
Karahari, you...

00:07:57.650 --> 00:07:59.770
We're leaving, my love!

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:00.740
Love?

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:01.680
Hurry!

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:02.570
Wait a second.

00:08:02.570 --> 00:08:04.050
Quickly, before the cops come!

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:11.220
I asked what you think...

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:14.420
About Kyohei-sama!

00:08:14.420 --> 00:08:17.470
I don't know what to say...

00:08:18.400 --> 00:08:20.490
You're pretty laid back about things.

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:24.690
I guess when you think you're 
winning, you can be like that.

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:26.270
That's not what I meant.

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:28.810
I don't understand...

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:31.890
Why does he hate the village?

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:36.240
Why did he abandon 
his position as Seki, his kakashi?

00:08:36.980 --> 00:08:40.340
He was so strong and cool...

00:08:40.940 --> 00:08:43.600
He could've overpowered anyone,

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:46.210
to do whatever he wanted!

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:47.700
So why?

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:49.590
Kuga-kun...

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:52.560
Kuga-kun told me...

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:56.840
That a power that's too strong 
will bring unhappiness.

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:05.400
Are you saying that, even with such 
a powerful kakashi,

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:07.270
there was still something he couldn't get?

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:09.010
That isn't it...

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:14.030
It's not about what he could or couldn't get...

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:16.120
That's stupid!

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:17.850
If he can have anything he wants,

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:19.750
how can he be unhappy?

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:22.040
Why would Kyohei-sama say that?

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:25.530
I wondered the same thing.

00:09:26.050 --> 00:09:27.500
The kakashi's power...

00:09:27.570 --> 00:09:29.010
Shut up! Shut up!

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:31.290
My kakashi kept me going in that village,

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:33.630
in that house...

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:34.900
It was everything!

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:37.130
And that power is wrong?!

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:40.140
That's not it... That's not what I meant...

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:41.140
Shut up!

00:09:51.030 --> 00:09:51.710
Kuga-kun!

00:09:51.710 --> 00:09:52.460
Utao-chan!

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:53.940
So heavy...

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:56.480
Don't jump off, you moron!

00:09:56.480 --> 00:09:57.910
Put us down somewhere.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:10.460
That was close...

00:10:12.470 --> 00:10:15.240
Kuga-kun, how did you find this place?

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:18.330
Karahari told us by phone.

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:19.570
Oh, right! Kuuko!

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:22.860
She let just me escape and then a 
gunshot went off. That wasn't...

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:25.350
Hibino-san, calm down.

00:10:25.590 --> 00:10:26.670
Mahiru-chan!

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:37.150
I won't embarrass myself anymore.

00:10:38.710 --> 00:10:40.930
I'll defeat everyone in my way,

00:10:40.930 --> 00:10:42.490
and I'll make Kyohei-sama mine!

00:10:42.810 --> 00:10:44.540
Stop it, Mahiru-san!

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:48.750
Mahiru, I'm not a Seki anymore.

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:52.380
But you can still return to the village with me.

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:55.000
I can't go with you.

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:57.960
Why not?

00:10:59.130 --> 00:10:59.910
Utao?

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:02.100
No, Utao-chan...

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:04.180
She wants to fight.

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:05.390
Why?

00:11:08.070 --> 00:11:09.710
Because I have power!

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:12.560
I'll prove to you that some people 
are better than others!

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:14.220
That's not true.

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:18.690
And I have a reason to fight, too.

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:22.070
You're going to apologize for 
trampling my cookies!

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:23.320
Your what?

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:27.450
You can't use Magatsuhi's barrier 
in a wide-open space like this.

00:11:32.610 --> 00:11:34.670
That's a reasonable handicap.

00:11:35.350 --> 00:11:37.960
Destroying you will still be easy.

00:11:43.810 --> 00:11:45.220
Don't underestimate me!

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:48.720
Same to you!

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:23.530
Look at them fighting...

00:12:23.530 --> 00:12:26.300
This is too pathetic to watch...

00:12:27.710 --> 00:12:29.100
Not bad, kid!

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:30.380
Shut up!

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:38.090
Magatsuhi!

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:44.000
Don't let her drag you down!

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:44.780
Right!

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:53.370
What's going on?

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:55.040
Stupid brat!

00:12:56.480 --> 00:12:58.130
Kuga-kun, stop her!

00:12:58.610 --> 00:13:01.120
Kuga-kun! Kuga...

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:04.180
This is the only way now.

00:13:04.180 --> 00:13:06.800
We have to let them burn themselves out.

00:13:08.170 --> 00:13:11.470
That's Mahiru-neesama and Utao!

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:16.010
We finally find them, and they've started a fight.

00:13:16.450 --> 00:13:17.490
Is that okay?

00:13:17.490 --> 00:13:19.910
We couldn't stop them now.

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:24.110
Worried?

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:26.830
I-I'm not worried about Utao!

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:29.280
I was talking about Mahiru.

00:13:34.170 --> 00:13:35.160
Get a picture!

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:41.300
<i>Mahiru. You're stronger now...</i>

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:45.050
<i>You've come so far since that day.</i>

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:49.760
Kyohei-sama was way stronger than you!

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:51.970
What?

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:54.980
Idiot! Don't get close to her!

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:05.820
<i>Magatsuhi is missing one of the 
strings used for her barrier.</i>

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:08.070
<i>That means its activation should take longer.</i>

00:14:08.270 --> 00:14:10.280
<i>That gives me a single instant...</i>

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:25.410
The hell is going on?

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:29.150
We're leaving!

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:32.970
Okay...

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:41.310
Utao, what are you doing?

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:44.370
Don't let down your concentration!

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:45.620
Are you trying to kill us?

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:46.880
I'm sorry!

00:14:51.860 --> 00:14:54.620
Get up, Magatsuhi.

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:56.880
What's wrong?

00:14:56.880 --> 00:14:59.000
Do as I say, Magatsuhi.

00:14:59.900 --> 00:15:01.080
Get up.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:01.960
Fly!

00:15:04.490 --> 00:15:06.670
Get up, Magatsuhi!

00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:08.900
Mahiru-chan...

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:13.300
She wanted this fight.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:14.820
Magatsuhi!

00:15:15.150 --> 00:15:16.280
Magatsuhi!

00:15:16.920 --> 00:15:18.100
Magatsuhi...

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:19.750
It's useless, Mahiru.

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:21.380
Magatsuhi... Magatsuhi... Magatsuhi...

00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:22.680
She cut clean through the control system.

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:24.130
Magatsuhi... Magatsuhi...

00:15:23.260 --> 00:15:25.370
It won't listen to you anymore.

00:15:24.390 --> 00:15:25.240
Magatsuhi...

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:27.020
Mahiru-san, let's stop this.

00:15:27.020 --> 00:15:27.690
Anymore is just...

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:29.120
Shut up!

00:15:29.120 --> 00:15:30.890
Stay out of this!

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:34.870
Hibino!

00:15:37.760 --> 00:15:40.020
No... No!

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:47.050
Magatsuhi?

00:15:48.940 --> 00:15:50.080
This is bad!

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:51.280
Mahiru, run!

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:53.090
Something's wrong with Magatsuhi!

00:16:02.050 --> 00:16:03.790
What do you think you're doing?

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:05.440
I'm your Seki, damn it!

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:09.350
Don't do anything, unless I tell you to!

00:16:09.350 --> 00:16:11.240
Put down the girl!

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:12.740
Mahiru-san?

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:15.040
She's nuts.

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:16.210
No...

00:16:16.210 --> 00:16:18.490
Magatsuhi...

00:16:19.030 --> 00:16:24.000
I said to put her down!

00:16:27.890 --> 00:16:30.160
She overcame it, with sheer mental energy.

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:31.680
That's insane...

00:16:39.610 --> 00:16:40.800
Kyohei-sama!

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:41.990
Hibino-san!

00:16:48.810 --> 00:16:49.850
Hibino-san!

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:50.780
Kuga-kun!

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:52.460
Magatsuhi!

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:54.710
Where are you going without me?

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:56.590
It's giving you what you wanted.

00:16:56.590 --> 00:16:57.910
What?

00:16:57.910 --> 00:16:59.880
Feelings accrue in the kakashi,

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:01.870
as you telepathically communicate with them.

00:17:02.550 --> 00:17:07.380
They're normally under control, 
but Kukuri's attack released them.

00:17:07.820 --> 00:17:10.410
So why is it doing that?

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:12.720
I'd rather it took Kyohei-sama!

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:15.730
You just told Hibino to stay out of this, right?

00:17:15.730 --> 00:17:17.340
That's...

00:17:18.110 --> 00:17:20.050
It doesn't matter why.

00:17:20.050 --> 00:17:22.140
We have to stop it first!

00:17:23.940 --> 00:17:26.030
Let Hibino go!

00:17:30.790 --> 00:17:32.690
One more!

00:17:42.650 --> 00:17:44.410
Hibino-san!

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:46.940
Kou!

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:48.000
This is bad.

00:17:48.340 --> 00:17:49.800
What do we do?

00:17:49.800 --> 00:17:53.220
We have to stop it, and somehow recover it.

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:56.380
I guess I'll try.

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:01.390
What?

00:18:03.460 --> 00:18:04.390
Kou!

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:05.430
It's fine.

00:18:06.300 --> 00:18:08.460
I didn't know Magatsuhi could do that.

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:11.000
I've never seen that before...

00:18:11.280 --> 00:18:16.030
That just means you were never 
able to fully control it.

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:17.060
I...

00:18:17.060 --> 00:18:18.830
It isn't only you.

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:24.410
A kakashi's abilities are influenced 
by its Seki's personality.

00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:28.080
Kuga-kun!

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:29.460
Kyohei!

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:35.890
Hibino-san!

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:36.630
Kuga-kun.

00:18:38.900 --> 00:18:39.840
Kyohei!

00:18:43.340 --> 00:18:44.310
Kyohei!

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:54.570
This is getting out of hand!

00:18:55.220 --> 00:18:57.330
Don't dodge downward. 
It'll hit the people below!

00:18:57.330 --> 00:18:57.900
Sorry!

00:19:01.730 --> 00:19:03.200
Okay, I'm behind it.

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:04.240
I'll cut off the arm!

00:19:05.550 --> 00:19:06.440
Me too!

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:11.540
Let Kyohei go!

00:19:19.350 --> 00:19:21.330
N-No...

00:19:21.330 --> 00:19:22.770
I didn't mean to, Utao.

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:24.080
Don't stop, idiot!

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:31.930
Let Hibino-san go, Magatsuhi...

00:19:31.930 --> 00:19:32.730
Kuga-kun!

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:50.620
<i>Going to a university in Tokyo?</i>

00:19:50.990 --> 00:19:52.930
<i>Kyohei, you...</i>

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:56.880
<i>I think it might be for the best.</i>

00:19:57.490 --> 00:20:00.130
<i>Now that you've relinquished your rights as a Seki,</i>

00:20:00.390 --> 00:20:03.750
<i>there's no reason for you to stay here.</i>

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:05.280
<i>Darling!</i>

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:08.590
<i>Go see the outside world for the time being.</i>

00:20:08.590 --> 00:20:10.660
<i>You'll become head of this household, eventually.</i>

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:12.980
<i>Do as you like for four years.</i>

00:20:13.950 --> 00:20:17.880
<i>At the same time as he allowed it,</i>

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:19.360
<i>he was warning me.</i>

00:20:20.050 --> 00:20:23.170
<i>I'll never escape this village.</i>

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:26.910
<i>But even so, I...</i>

00:20:27.770 --> 00:20:28.810
<i>Kyohei!</i>

00:20:28.810 --> 00:20:30.380
<i>Wait, Kyohei!</i>

00:20:32.340 --> 00:20:34.860
<i>Mom... I'm sorry.</i>

00:20:34.860 --> 00:20:39.590
<i>But I... I can't say why, but...</i>

00:20:39.940 --> 00:20:42.900
<i>I want to live my own life,</i>

00:20:43.960 --> 00:20:48.180
<i>not one the village prepared for me!</i>

00:20:49.990 --> 00:20:52.560
<i>Wh-What?</i>

00:20:52.880 --> 00:20:55.220
<i>You've grown up.</i>

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:58.150
<i>I can't even pat your head anymore.</i>

00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:00.780
<i>Stay healthy.</i>

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:03.400
<i>Take care of yourself.</i>

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:05.000
<i>Mom...</i>

00:21:06.260 --> 00:21:08.070
<i>This is my daughter, Hibino.</i>

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:09.890
<i>I'm Shiba Hibino.</i>

00:21:10.270 --> 00:21:11.410
<i>Nice to meet you.</i>

00:21:12.190 --> 00:21:13.890
<i>What a coincidence,</i>

00:21:13.890 --> 00:21:16.070
<i>to be attending the same university.</i>

00:21:16.070 --> 00:21:17.770
<i>What program are you in?</i>

00:21:17.770 --> 00:21:19.170
<i>Um...</i>

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:22.260
<i>It looks like that's your apartment.</i>

00:21:25.900 --> 00:21:27.130
<i>Hibino-san!</i>

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:35.810
Will the village take her from me, too?

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:35.810
Kuga-kun!

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:39.440
I won't let it! I won't...

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:37.200
It's time for the last Kamisama Dolls Corner.

00:23:37.200 --> 00:23:38.800
No! I don't want it to be the last one!

00:23:38.800 --> 00:23:40.710
Let's have an entire show of the Corner!

00:23:40.710 --> 00:23:41.600
Let's do it...

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:42.650
Kukuri says we should!

00:23:42.650 --> 00:23:43.810
Please let the show keep going!

00:23:43.810 --> 00:23:44.920
Beam beam beam!

00:23:44.770 --> 00:23:49.770
<b>Next Episode: 
Kuga Kyohei, the Seki</b>

00:23:44.920 --> 00:23:46.400
Next time: the final episode of <i>Kamisama Dolls</i>,

00:23:46.400 --> 00:23:47.540
Kuga Kyohei, the Seki.

00:23:47.540 --> 00:23:49.770
And let's see each other again sometime!
